	<row id="msg_0808_furfrou_matron" index="1220">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Historically, in the Kalos region,\nthese Pokémon were the designated\nguardians of the king.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_furfrou_dandy" index="1221">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Historically, in the Kalos region,\nthese Pokémon were the designated\nguardians of the king.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_furfrou_la_reine" index="1222">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Historically, in the Kalos region,\nthese Pokémon were the designated\nguardians of the king.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_furfrou_kabuki" index="1223">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Historically, in the Kalos region,\nthese Pokémon were the designated\nguardians of the king.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_furfrou_pharaoh" index="1224">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Historically, in the Kalos region,\nthese Pokémon were the designated\nguardians of the king.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_aegislash_blade" index="1225">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It can detect the innate qualities of\nleadership. Whoever it recognizes is\ndestined to become king.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_pumpkaboo_small" index="1226">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It is said to carry wandering spirits\nto the place where they belong so they\ncan move on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_pumpkaboo_large" index="1227">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It is said to carry wandering spirits\nto the place where they belong so they\ncan move on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_pumpkaboo_super" index="1228">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It is said to carry wandering spirits\nto the place where they belong so they\ncan move on.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_gourgeist_small" index="1229">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It enwraps its prey in its hairlike\narms. It sings joyfully as it observes\nthe suffering of its prey.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_gourgeist_large" index="1230">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It enwraps its prey in its hairlike\narms. It sings joyfully as it observes\nthe suffering of its prey.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_gourgeist_super" index="1231">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It enwraps its prey in its hairlike\narms. It sings joyfully as it observes\nthe suffering of its prey.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_xerneas_active" index="1232">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When the horns on its head shine in\nseven different colors, it is said to be\nsharing everlasting life.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_zygarde_10" index="1233">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls\ninto disarray, it appears and reveals\nits secret power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_zygarde_10_power_construct" index="1234">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls\ninto disarray, it appears and reveals\nits secret power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_zygarde_50_power_construct" index="1235">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls\ninto disarray, it appears and reveals\nits secret power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_zygarde_10_complete" index="1236">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls\ninto disarray, it appears and reveals\nits secret power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_zygarde_50_complete" index="1237">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When the Kalos region’s ecosystem falls\ninto disarray, it appears and reveals\nits secret power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_hoopa_unbound" index="1238">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It gathers things it likes and passes\nthem through its loop to teleport them\nto a secret place.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_oricorio_pom_pom" index="1239">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Oricorio has sipped red nectar. Its\npassionate dance moves cause its enemies\nto combust in both body and mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_oricorio_pau" index="1240">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Oricorio has sipped red nectar. Its\npassionate dance moves cause its enemies\nto combust in both body and mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_oricorio_sensu" index="1241">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Oricorio has sipped red nectar. Its\npassionate dance moves cause its enemies\nto combust in both body and mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_rockruff_own_tempo" index="1242">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When it rubs the rocks on its neck\nagainst you, that’s proof of its love\nfor you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_lycanroc_midnight" index="1243">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well equipped with claws and fangs, it\nuses the sharp rocks in its mane as\nweapons.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_lycanroc_dusk" index="1244">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well equipped with claws and fangs, it\nuses the sharp rocks in its mane as\nweapons.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_wishiwashi_school" index="1245">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They’re weak, so they move in schools.\nHowever, they can also often be seen all\nalone, having strayed from the school.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_minior_meteor_orange" index="1246">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It eats dust in the atmosphere. The\ncomposition of the dust determines the\ncolor of its core.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_minior_meteor_yellow" index="1247">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It eats dust in the atmosphere. The\ncomposition of the dust determines the\ncolor of its core.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0808_minior_meteor_green" index="1248">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It eats dust in the atmosphere. The\ncomposition of the dust determines the\ncolor of its core.</language>
